*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
